                    "Organization Lore: Church" XP 50
                    "Folk Ken" XP 10
                    "Profession (see earlier)" XP 15
                }
                "Three Years" YEARS 3 PRINTED "+30 Organization Lore: Church, +15 Profession (see earlier)" {
                    "Organization Lore: Church" XP 30
                    "Profession (see earlier)" XP 15
                }
            }
            DESCRIPTION "A lay brother works at a monastery, but has not taken Holy Orders. This package is also suitable for novices preparing for ordination. In the latter case, some years of Student are appropriate. The Profession Ability could be Scribe, Gardener, Brewer, or any other suitable trade."
        }

