                }
            }
            DESCRIPTION "A natural philosopher seeks to uncover the wonders of the natural world through his studies. The focus\n\nof a natural philosopher could equally be Artes Liberales or Medicine. For rules on formulae, see *Art & Academe*, Chapter 5."
            MENTIONS {
